  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Productive Integration of Venezuelan Refugees and Migrants in Latin America Program - Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With Citi Foundation&#x2019;s investment, in Phase III, IOM continues to empower Venezuelan migrants in Ecuador and Peru, particularly migrant women, with social mentoring sessions, entrepreneurship skills training, and start-up support to access sustainable income sources and promote a broader understanding of migrants&#x2019; positive contributions to their host communities and beyond. Therefore, the program advances Citi Foundation&apos;s commitment to expanding global youth employment and contributes to reduce gender gaps in local labor markets. By building upon previous programming to enhance and expand the impact in R&amp;M&#x2019;s socioeconomic integration, activities will be delivered in three components: skills training; entrepreneurship and start-up support; and promotion of understanding of women migrants as agents of socioeconomic development.</narrative>
  </description>
